<title>AUSTRALIA: Vision year net profit up 16 percent.</title>
<headline>Vision year net profit up 16 percent.</headline>
<dateline>MELBOURNE 1996-09-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to June 30</p>
<p>		 (million A$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Operating profit		    10.61 vs 9.01</p>
<p>    Net				     10.64 vs 9.14</p>
<p>    Final dividend (cents)	    12.00 vs 10.00</p>
<p>    Total dividend (cents)	    22.00 vs 18.00</p>
<p>    Sales				   84.78 vs 37.02</p>
<p>    Other income			   5.13 vs 6.19</p>
<p>    Shr (cents)			  100.01 vs 92.00</p>
<p>    Abnormal items			  nil vs nil</p>
<p>Dividend is unfranked  </p>
