<p>    Tax					0.03 vs 0.13</p>
<p>    Interest				 0.94 vs 0.61</p>
<p>    Depreciation			   4.67 vs 3.74</p>
<p>    Minorities				nil vs nil</p>
<p>NOTE: Vision Systems Ltd is an electronic products manufacturer.</p>
<p>-- Sydney Newsroom 61-2 373 1800</p>
